  "description": "NEW TO THE MARKET\n\n4 BEDROOM DETACHED COUNTRY RESIDENCE ON C.7.3 ACRES\n\nWITH STABLES, WORKSHOP & DEVELOPMENT POTENTIAL\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this unique countryside property comprising a 4 bedroom detached residence standing on c.7.3 acres of quality lands together with stables, workshop and additional development potential.\n\nSituated in a peaceful rural setting just off the main N5 Ballinagare to Tulsk Road, this property offers an excellent opportunity for hobby farming, equestrian pursuits, small-scale agriculture or those seeking a country residence with extensive outdoor space.\n\nThe residence provides comfortable living accommodation while the lands and outbuildings offer enormous potential for a variety of uses.\n\nAccommodation Comprises:\n\nKitchen\n\nBedroom 1\n\nBedroom 2\n\nBedroom 3\n\nBedroom 4\n\nMain Bathroom\n\nOutside:\n\n• c.7.3 acres of top quality lands\n• Two stables with non-drip roof\n• Workshop with lean-to (approx. 30ft x 15ft)\n• Old stone ruin with previous planning permission and footings established\n• Potential eligibility for available grant schemes subject to approval\n• Excellent road frontage\n• Well water and septic tank\n• PVC windows and doors\n\nLocation Highlights:\n\n• Just off the main N5 Ballinagare to Tulsk Road\n• Quiet rural setting\n• Castlerea, Roscommon and Carrick-on-Shannon all easily accessible\n• Approx. 30 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a country residence with lands, equestrian facilities and future development potential in a highly accessible location.\n\nViewing strictly by appointment only.\n\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers\nEverything we touch turns to SOLD",
